{
  "format_version": 1,
  "scope": [
    "Finite abstract protocol models; no production Rust refinement proof",
    "Exactly two one-shot transactions, two rows, two nonzero keys; one index with one or two publication buckets",
    "Publication/durability enumerate all interleavings in explicit finite one-shot configurations; no depth/state constraints",
    "Exact snapshot row materialization is assumed; allocator, process-sharing and weak-memory implementations are not modeled",
    "Durability unsafe candidates are model counterexamples, not reproduced Rust crashes; safe variants are proposed model-only designs",
